{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37160","headline":"吊贾岛 · 李克恭","name":"吊贾岛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一一玄微缥缈成，尽吟方便爽神情。\n宣宗谪去爲闲事，韩愈知来已振名。\n海底也应搜得净，月轮常被翫教倾。\n如何未隔四十载，不遇论量向此生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李克恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}